      "desc": "Rules for using the Clincoo platform: accounts, site publishing, AI features, prohibited content, payments, and limitation of liability.",
      "content": "<p class=\"mb-4\">This document governs the use of <strong>Clincoo</strong> by all users. By creating an account, accessing, or using Clincoo, you are deemed to have read, understood, and agreed to these Terms & Conditions.</p><p class=\"mb-4\"><em>Last updated: 26 October 2026.</em></p><h2 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-2\">1. Definitions</h2><p class=\"mb-4\">For clarity, the following terms are used in this document:</p><table class=\"w-full border-collapse mb-4 text-sm\"><thead><tr><th class=\"border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 px-3 py-2 text-left\">Term</th><th class=\"border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 px-3 py-2 text-left\">Meaning</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"border border-gray-200 px-3 py-2\"><strong>Clincoo</strong></td><td class=\"border border-gray-200 px-3 py-2\">A platform that lets users build, edit, and publish websites from the browser, including workspace, templates, GitHub & Cloudflare integration, digital wallet, and AI assistant.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"border border-gray-200 px-3 py-2\"><strong>User</strong></td><td class=\"border border-gray-200 px-3 py-2\">Anyone who accesses or uses Clincoo, with or without an account.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"border border-gray-200 px-3 py-2\"><strong>Account</strong></td><td class=\"border border-gray-200 px-3 py-2\">A registered identity on Clincoo used to access authenticated features.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"border border-gray-200 px-3 py-2\"><strong>Content</strong></td><td class=\"border border-gray-200 px-3 py-2\">Any text, code, images, files, or other data uploaded, created, or stored by the User in the service.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"border border-gray-200 px-3 py-2\"><strong>Published site</strong></td><td class=\"border border-gray-200 px-3 py-2\">The result of deploying a User project, accessible via a Clincoo subdomain or custom domain.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"border border-gray-200 px-3 py-2\"><strong>Clincoo AI</strong></td><td class=\"border border-gray-200 px-3 py-2\">The artificial-intelligence assistant features that help with explanations, suggestions, and writing code or content.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"border border-gray-200 px-3 py-2\"><strong>Balance / Wallet</strong></td><td class=\"border border-gray-200 px-3 py-2\">Credit held in an account that may be used for paid plans, premium features, or related services.</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-2\">2. Account and security</h2><ul class=\"list-disc pl-5 mb-4 space-y-1\"><li>You must provide accurate information when registering and keep it up to date.</li><li>You are solely responsible for keeping your credentials confidential.</li><li>Activity under your account is considered yours unless you reasonably prove otherwise.</li><li>Report suspected account misuse to us promptly.</li><li>We may refuse, suspend, or delete accounts that violate these terms, provide false data, or pose a security risk.</li><li>Long-inactive accounts may be removed after notice to the registered email.</li></ul><h2 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-2\">3. Service description</h2><p class=\"mb-4\">Clincoo provides a browser-based workspace to create and manage websites. Main features include editor, templates, deploy, AI assistant, project management, and digital wallet.</p><h2 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-2\">4. Site publishing and content responsibility</h2><ul class=\"list-disc pl-5 mb-4 space-y-1\"><li>Sites you create and publish are entirely your responsibility.</li><li>We may review, disable, or remove content that violates these terms.</li><li>We do not guarantee 100% availability.</li></ul><h2 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-2\">5. Prohibited content</h2><p class=\"mb-4\">You must not create or publish content related to online gambling, money laundering, illegal substances, child exploitation, violence, copyright infringement, malware, or other content prohibited under Indonesian law.</p><h2 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-2\">6. AI features</h2><ul class=\"list-disc pl-5 mb-4 space-y-1\"><li>AI output is assistance only. Verify before publishing.</li><li>You remain fully responsible for final published content.</li></ul><h2 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-2\">7. Plans, payment, and balance</h2><ul class=\"list-disc pl-5 mb-4 space-y-1\"><li>Some features are free; others require a paid plan or balance.</li><li>Processed payments are generally non-refundable except where required by law.</li></ul><h2 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-2\">8. Intellectual property</h2><p class=\"mb-4\">You retain rights to your original content. The Clincoo platform brand, interface, and code belong to Clincoo or its licensors.</p><h2 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-2\">9. Limitation of liability</h2><p class=\"mb-4\">The service is provided as is. Our aggregate liability is limited to amounts paid in the twelve months before a claim, or the minimum required by law.</p><h2 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-2\">10. Suspension and termination</h2><p class=\"mb-4\">You may stop using the service at any time. We may suspend or terminate access for violations or legal requirements.</p><h2 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-2\">11. Changes to these terms</h2><p class=\"mb-4\">We may update these Terms. Continued use after changes constitutes acceptance.</p><h2 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-2\">12. Governing law</h2><p class=\"mb-4\">These Terms are governed by the laws of the Republic of Indonesia.</p><h2 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-2\">13. Contact</h2><p class=\"mb-4\">Email: <strong>halo@clincoo.buzz</strong> · App: <a href=\"https://app.clincoo.buzz\" class=\"underline\">app.clincoo.buzz</a> · Docs: <a href=\"https://docs.clincoo.buzz\" class=\"underline\">docs.clincoo.buzz</a></p>"
